    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 168,
        "text": "Good morning, everyone. Today we're doing a transition check for your academic tasks. Let's start with the group presentation. Li, how is your group progressing?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "2c6cfb76ae56c69f1fb52c14d088c9147ae633f23e011a6a537aba82ce002b63",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "li",
        "speaker": "Li",
        "sourceStart": 173,
        "sourceEnd": 309,
        "text": "We've finished the outline, but we're still working on the slides. We have three members, and each of us is responsible for one section.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "de56415067945027c338372b89993aa280e8d56f3144b87e54e30fdc9cbb3746",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 317,
        "sourceEnd": 424,
        "text": "Good. Remember, the presentation should last fifteen minutes, not fifty. And make sure every member speaks.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "87e7cc68161c97fca4eaf28d00228c22f2fe2bf6d27a848c8726047301aa639e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "li",
        "speaker": "Li",
        "sourceStart": 429,
        "sourceEnd": 468,
        "text": "Yes, we know. We'll practise next week.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "7043f66cbce61c1586b7a6c7f0b60b7314529f773d57cda766be2d01c00ea001",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 476,
        "sourceEnd": 560,
        "text": "Now, about the essay. Chen, you had some issues with verb tenses in your last draft.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "dd36dd6017818df9e5e4350419a5456c96d829610f9562a317fee7f3bfcd36b9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "chen",
        "speaker": "Chen",
        "sourceStart": 567,
        "sourceEnd": 659,
        "text": "Yes, I mixed past and present tenses. I've reviewed the feedback and corrected most of them.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "573e76ab2994665e174acb35186431e964ce26cef2a715e0a62e89ca04c8b07a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 667,
        "sourceEnd": 788,
        "text": "That's good. Also, check your articles. You wrote 'a research' but it should be 'some research' or 'a piece of research'.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "0a41ec34fe706995410ffa576386e905c0c24614ec130db812052678a2c13b39",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "chen",
        "speaker": "Chen",
        "sourceStart": 795,
        "sourceEnd": 816,
        "text": "I see. I'll fix that.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "69ebbe0517dfebc17398fabb3d5321c775ff9c7673984f2c8574aa7c7081bcc7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 824,
        "sourceEnd": 926,
        "text": "Wang, your main problem was subject-verb agreement. You wrote 'The number of students are increasing'.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "c8b3bb570b76a899269e42d84f2f53c4b8587cb570ec1524f43d8914d38c8ec4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "wang",
        "speaker": "Wang",
        "sourceStart": 933,
        "sourceEnd": 1006,
        "text": "Oh, right. It should be 'is increasing' because 'the number' is singular.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f9d172ee9f399ee0ca30e82e089489c452c9892de83f21a0c32d85e8821af8f4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1014,
        "sourceEnd": 1057,
        "text": "Exactly. And what about your data analysis?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "49216985402cd0977c00419f7c86c55e4bc600a3c307c8c0e41fbff6ab9a6298",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "wang",
        "speaker": "Wang",
        "sourceStart": 1064,
        "sourceEnd": 1128,
        "text": "I've collected all the data, and the results show a clear trend.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "e517c03dc83edb7a095d9938c2ca5244e817986b67e4932544c0bae0b32d6070",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1136,
        "sourceEnd": 1249,
        "text": "Good. Now, let's talk about the deadline. The final submission is on Friday, the 15th. That's two weeks from now.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "dd8eaf7e7301700661d56b867b90cb30035e841ac76f35b26dc763f12f8cca02",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "li",
        "speaker": "Li",
        "sourceStart": 1254,
        "sourceEnd": 1311,
        "text": "Is it the 15th or the 5th? I wrote the 5th in my planner.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "a9695a9a6fde9c84fe334cf476ce45d9712687984c97fecf59160b4cf292b5b9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1319,
        "sourceEnd": 1362,
        "text": "It's the 15th. Please correct your planner.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "d89e189c0fac1e87dc1cbb6edeff47fe7cda16213becad1d70ddb93060abb8d6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "chen",
        "speaker": "Chen",
        "sourceStart": 1369,
        "sourceEnd": 1435,
        "text": "Will we have a chance to get feedback before the final submission?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "fb9d5cd4a84e62f2402a182341c0857e9608b9bb9636e9b07cf6de703fd9794b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1443,
        "sourceEnd": 1520,
        "text": "Yes, you can submit a draft by the 8th, and I'll return it within three days.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "85d2adc24f9db04c6cd5d931cfa830d6feb57f1b24618c12229f03c47ec62003",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "wang",
        "speaker": "Wang",
        "sourceStart": 1527,
        "sourceEnd": 1593,
        "text": "That's helpful. So we have one week to revise after your feedback.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f2380723661968d35de8f802e36a8f86049f520ef5f64252816ac798c017ce74",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1601,
        "sourceEnd": 1742,
        "text": "Correct. Now, one more thing: the library workshop on referencing is on Wednesday at 2 p.m. It's not compulsory, but I strongly recommend it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "ffe0b9c34cf58e98c5d2f1c7e3af642c786324706e0b6bab2537e4a25c2a8275",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "li",
        "speaker": "Li",
        "sourceStart": 1747,
        "sourceEnd": 1789,
        "text": "I'll be there. I need help with citations.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "37c8f808536095c915955ed31ec0d7bc8628a3fdf6042ff3d74c99020fe0f6cb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1797,
        "sourceEnd": 1880,
        "text": "Great. Any other questions? No? Then let's move on to the next part of the session.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "5c7d114b85eef967995b7f39fe51c0d646fce1443ec8385bb96b9edd32cb153b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
